    - target: {fileID: 6154453296954000768, guid: 6745026ecead911a8841203e1b6becb9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "You won! \nYou have destroyed your evil future self! The Universe is
        safe, at least until you become the evil version of yourself again. Then
        it will all turn around, time is a flat circle, etc... You get the idea?
        \nWell, now you unlocked a special level in which you can prove to the world
        who's the best! There will be no boss and it has a High Score table!\n\nThank
        You for Playing!\n2026 by Piotr Kaczmarski\nPlease, help build the potato
        community on Discord, Twitch or YouTube!"
